Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:18:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] 078 (2/2): 3720, MOLES and CATCH at stu32-arcade 7686766

Three games for a young player who doesn't read yet (Michael's asks; work/078-kids-games.md): 3720 flies through the
rocks, MOLES bonks moles in the number pad's layout, CATCH catches falling stars; MOLES and CATCH have gentle, middle
and full. games.list appends them, so GAMES's second page is SALVO, 3720, MOLES, CATCH; app_test checks that page;
the stand-in scripts reach each game through GAMES and tell its live keys from a dead one by the tones. Flash +21,760
(stand-in) and +21,392 (Rev A), internal RAM +0. Version 0.78.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
